solution:
Let $P$ be the foot of the perpendicular from $F$ to the line containing $AB$. [asy]size(150);
defaultpen(linewidth(0.7) + fontsize(10)); real lsf = 0.6;
pair C = (2,0), B = 2*dir(60), A = 2*dir(120), F = -C, E = -B, D = -A, P = foot(F,A,B), Y = B+(4,0);
